            <div xml:id="d461-a1">

                <pb facs="0709" n="619" sameAs="frus:frus1932v02/pg619"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Yugoslav Ministry for Foreign Affairs to the
                        American Legation</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 23846/7140/II</seg>
                </opener>
                <p rendition="#center"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Note Verbale</hi></p>
                <p>With reference to the <hi rendition="#italic">note verbale</hi> of the Legation
                    of the United States of America No. 2511, dated June 29, 1932, the Royal
                    Ministry <pb facs="0710" n="620" xml:id="pg620"/> for Foreign Affairs has the
                    honor to communicate to it that, according to information received from the
                    Ministry of the Interior, John Belan has been removed from the lists of persons
                    resident in the Commune of Ribnik, and from the respective military registers as
                    well.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Belgrade</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1932-08-25">August 25, 1932.</date></dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
